          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148972,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Abbiamo visto come l'albero del documento HTML ci aiuta a capire come gli elementi compaiono in una gerarchia.</p><p>Ora scoprirai le potenzialità dell'utilizzo di questi elementi come oggetti JavaScript nel tuo codice costruendo una piccola HUD di gioco!</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148973,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il Document Object Model (DOM) è un'interfaccia JavaScript per le pagine web. Rappresenta il documento come nodi e oggetti.</p><p>Nell'interfaccia di gioco, il DOM ci permette di accedere agli elementi HTML (come salute e punteggio).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148974,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La prima cosa che il DOM ci permette di fare è accedere al nodo HTML radice con la parola chiave JavaScript <code>document</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Arcade HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Level 1\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ol\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health: 3\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Score: 0\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"li\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"ol\" class=\"name\" /><text